## Scenarios

### dylib_async backend ownership

#### routes self handles without kernel dynamic loader

- Verify: routes self handles without kernel dynamic loader
   - Expected: dylib_backend_for_path("") equals `DYLIB_BACKEND_SELF`
   - Expected: dylib_backend_for_path("self") equals `DYLIB_BACKEND_SELF`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 4 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-OS-POSIX-001
step("Verify: routes self handles without kernel dynamic loader")
expect(dylib_backend_for_path("")).to_equal(DYLIB_BACKEND_SELF)
expect(dylib_backend_for_path("self")).to_equal(DYLIB_BACKEND_SELF)
```

</details>

#### routes SMF and absolute paths to kernel dynamic loader

- Verify: routes SMF and absolute paths to kernel dynamic loader
   - Expected: dylib_backend_for_path("/lib/app.smf") equals `DYLIB_BACKEND_KERNEL`
   - Expected: dylib_backend_for_path("plugin.smf") equals `DYLIB_BACKEND_KERNEL`
   - Expected: dylib_backend_for_path("plugin.so") equals `DYLIB_BACKEND_KERNEL`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 5 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-OS-POSIX-001
step("Verify: routes SMF and absolute paths to kernel dynamic loader")
expect(dylib_backend_for_path("/lib/app.smf")).to_equal(DYLIB_BACKEND_KERNEL)
expect(dylib_backend_for_path("plugin.smf")).to_equal(DYLIB_BACKEND_KERNEL)
expect(dylib_backend_for_path("plugin.so")).to_equal(DYLIB_BACKEND_KERNEL)
```

</details>

#### rejects ambiguous relative paths

- Verify: rejects ambiguous relative paths
   - Expected: dylib_backend_for_path("plugin") equals `DYLIB_BACKEND_INVALID`


